        {
          "text": "Nenyu yĩla mwaĩ akw’ũ kwondũ wa mavĩtyo menyu na kũlea kwaĩkwa kwa mĩĩ yenyu, inyw’ĩ, nĩwamũtw’ĩkĩthisye kwĩthĩwa thayũ vamwe nake, atũekeete mavĩtyo maitũ onthe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
